			"Message": "style(Wind): Reformat build configuration and compiled output to readable format\n\nReformat all ESBuild configuration files (BaseConfig, CompileConfig, TargetConfig) and Target/ output files from minified single-line format to expanded multi-line format with proper spacing and named exports. This includes:\n\n- Configuration/ESBuild/Config/*.js: Expanded imports and exports, added proper variable declarations\n- Configuration/ESBuild/Constant/*.js: Formatted export statements\n- Target/Effect/, Target/Bootstrap/, Target/FileSystem/, Target/Workbench/: All compiled JS files reformatted\n- Target/Configuration/ESBuild/: All configuration output files reformatted\n\nNo functional changes - purely formatting improvements to aid debugging and code review. The transpiled output now includes source maps (//# sourceMappingURL=) and maintains proper module structure.",
